WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.880 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.440 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.000
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.640 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.930 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.400 --> 01:04.400
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.890 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:29.130 --> 01:31.540
Eh? A Halloween party?

01:31.870 --> 01:33.070
What's that?

01:33.410 --> 01:36.780
I don't know, but I heard it's a human festival,

01:37.140 --> 01:41.810
and that even at school, they're throwing
some kind of Halloween party!

01:41.810 --> 01:45.750
What's more, the teacher offered me a
position on the planning committee.

01:46.220 --> 01:49.250
A party sounds like fun. Go for it!

01:49.250 --> 01:52.560
No way! No way! I could never
be a committee member!

01:53.060 --> 01:55.760
Kato! Don't make Vanilla cry!

01:56.340 --> 01:58.590
That's right! That's right! Poor Vanilla!

01:59.130 --> 02:02.670
Y'know what? Vanilla sheds tears
like most people sweat.

02:02.670 --> 02:05.200
Whenever she gets a teensy bit nervous
over something, off go the waterworks!

02:05.200 --> 02:07.140
It's a girl's secret weapon, kinda.

02:07.140 --> 02:10.070
Though Kato's better off without a weapon.

02:10.410 --> 02:11.810
Well EXCUSE ME!

02:12.210 --> 02:15.360
Ah! Ice-san, you're still here?

02:15.910 --> 02:20.120
Didn't I tell you to attend the Halloween
party planning meeting?

02:20.550 --> 02:23.520
But I just can't be a committee member!

02:24.260 --> 02:26.220
You'll be fine, Ice-san.

02:26.220 --> 02:29.830
You're just going to discuss what events will make up the party this year.

02:30.160 --> 02:31.430
Events?

02:31.430 --> 02:36.800
Yes. Every year committee members disguised in monster costumes entertain the guests.

02:37.540 --> 02:39.100
Monster costumes?!

02:39.670 --> 02:42.100
What? Sounds like a blast!

02:43.310 --> 02:46.600
Halloween parties and costumes go hand-in-hand.

02:46.850 --> 02:50.550
So this Halloween party's kinda
like a test of courage, huh?

02:50.920 --> 02:53.780
Ah, well – Kato-san, don't you
know what Halloween is?

02:54.490 --> 02:55.610
Nope!

02:56.490 --> 02:58.490
Well, let me tell you, then.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.830
Halloween is, you see...

03:00.830 --> 03:06.950
During the harvest time in autumn, people go to parties dressed up in monster costumes.

03:07.150 --> 03:10.070
And children go trick-or-treating for fun,

03:10.070 --> 03:15.130
where they go to people's houses and threaten to
play tricks on them if they don't give them treats.

03:15.670 --> 03:22.840
It was originally meant to scare away the evil
spirits that came around during harvest.

03:22.840 --> 03:28.020
Ah! So it's "gimme a treat or we'll
play a trick on you"! Sounds fun!

03:28.490 --> 03:31.050
Just like what I used to do in the Magic World.

03:31.720 --> 03:35.530
Hey! I'll take your place on
the Halloween Committee.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.100
You will?

03:37.100 --> 03:37.460
Yeah!

03:38.100 --> 03:39.660
That's cool with you, Sensei?

03:40.000 --> 03:41.780
That's fine with me, but...

03:42.700 --> 03:46.170
...just don't over-do it, Kato-san...

03:47.270 --> 03:48.310
All right!

03:48.310 --> 03:50.940
I'm gonna make everyone wet their pants!

03:51.410 --> 03:53.210
Will it be okay, I wonder...

03:53.610 --> 03:57.950
Okay! I'm headed off to the committee meeting now!

03:58.850 --> 04:01.520
Super Scary! Halloween Test of Courage!?

04:05.490 --> 04:06.640
*Agh--*

04:09.690 --> 04:12.460
Out of all the people in this school,
I had to be stuck with the Members?

04:13.870 --> 04:15.860
What a chilly atmosphere.

04:16.800 --> 04:21.110
Now that everyone is here, let's begin the
Halloween Party Committee meeting.

04:21.670 --> 04:27.240
Let's get straight to business, then. Are there any suggestions for the main event this year?

04:28.550 --> 04:32.380
Now that we're together, I would
like a fresh perspective...

04:32.780 --> 04:34.340
From the elementary school representative.

04:34.620 --> 04:36.320
M-me?!

04:41.690 --> 04:44.930
They'll have more reason to mock me if
I don't come up with somethin' good.

04:45.430 --> 04:48.100
No matter. I'll do whatever!

04:49.900 --> 04:55.310
I personally think we should
scare everyone spitless!

04:55.310 --> 04:58.110
I propose a Super Scary Halloween Test of Courage!

05:01.610 --> 05:03.150
What's this kid talking about?

05:03.150 --> 05:04.750
What "test of courage"?

05:04.750 --> 05:09.120
What does she think this is, some family event?

05:09.120 --> 05:11.660
That isn't even worth discussing.

05:11.660 --> 05:15.260
But a "test of courage" is indeed
a fresh approach to this.

05:16.690 --> 05:20.960
It's like a cross-over of East meeting West.

05:21.200 --> 05:23.930
You really think so? It's so vulgar...

05:24.440 --> 05:26.170
Well then, what do you suggest?

05:26.800 --> 05:28.010
Well, that's...

05:28.970 --> 05:30.940
Anyone else?

05:32.380 --> 05:33.890
Nothing in particular.

05:34.110 --> 05:39.520
Well then, for this years Halloween party, we
will adopt Chocolat Kato-san's proposal.

05:40.020 --> 05:45.560
The title is: "The Super Scar–" I mean, "The Quite Frightful Halloween Test of Courage."

05:47.890 --> 05:49.130
You mean we're gonna do it?

05:52.400 --> 05:55.230
So the Halloween party's going
to have a test of courage in it?

05:55.670 --> 05:56.300
Looks like it.

05:57.700 --> 06:00.570
I'm amazed the Members actually agreed to your plan.

06:00.570 --> 06:03.980
I worry that they might try to make things difficult for you.

06:03.980 --> 06:05.110
Whattaya mean?

06:05.440 --> 06:11.250
It's just that perhaps they are simply bullying you:
loading up all the work on your shoulders like that.

06:11.520 --> 06:12.950
No way. Seriously?

06:13.420 --> 06:15.090
Those conniving–

06:15.850 --> 06:20.990
But it's likely, with that Yurika girl...

06:22.790 --> 06:26.660
They can bring it on! I'll whup their
butts if they try anything!

06:31.700 --> 06:33.800
What's the deal, with such a shady car?

06:35.640 --> 06:36.640
Yurika-san...

06:37.080 --> 06:38.260
Kato-san,

06:38.260 --> 06:43.210
would it be all right if we went to my house for a
little bit to discuss further details of the party?

06:44.380 --> 06:45.420
Chocolat-chan.

06:46.550 --> 06:50.460
Don't worry. If she tries to pull anything
fishy, I'll whup her butt!

06:50.460 --> 06:51.220
But!

06:51.620 --> 06:55.730
I gotta know more about this girl.

06:56.160 --> 06:57.730
Then! Getting on board!

06:57.730 --> 06:58.760
Sorry for the trouble.

07:08.710 --> 07:10.360
Is this a castle or somethin'?!

07:10.810 --> 07:16.210
We reconstructed an old European castle
here. My mother was quite fond of it.

07:17.450 --> 07:21.390
This is too much. I can't even do
somethin' like that with magic.

07:23.020 --> 07:24.990
Welcome home!

07:25.660 --> 07:29.010
Wow, is that some sorta princess?

07:30.230 --> 07:31.400
It's my mother.

07:31.930 --> 07:34.200
Though she is no longer with us.

07:35.270 --> 07:38.070
She passed away right after I was born.

07:38.770 --> 07:41.520
I wish, just once, I could have heard her voice.

07:43.570 --> 07:45.210
Well! Right this way, please.

07:49.410 --> 07:52.880
Yurika-san's mother isn't here either, just like mine.

08:03.390 --> 08:06.860
Uh...are they always like that?

08:06.860 --> 08:07.630
Yes.

08:08.870 --> 08:11.130
How about tea before work?

08:13.200 --> 08:14.640
If you'll excuse us.

08:16.110 --> 08:19.780
Awesome! How many maids do you have?

08:19.780 --> 08:21.450
An uncountable amount.

08:22.210 --> 08:26.190
But for some reason, I still feel like I live alone here.

08:28.220 --> 08:30.850
Please! Help yourself before the tea gets cold.

08:35.490 --> 08:37.690
Yum! What flavor!

08:38.000 --> 08:38.900
I'm glad.

08:39.400 --> 08:42.600
I had this tea blended for you because
I associated it with my image of you.

08:43.270 --> 08:44.960
Your image of me?

08:45.300 --> 08:50.460
Yes, a bright and energetic young
lady. That sort of image.

08:51.740 --> 08:54.910
That smile took me by surprise.

08:55.980 --> 08:58.350
She may not be that bad after all.

09:00.450 --> 09:03.720
Eh? You had all these drawings
made for Halloween??

09:04.360 --> 09:05.860
Are there any that please you?

09:08.560 --> 09:09.650
This one! That's great!

09:09.860 --> 09:14.170
Everyone'll freak out when they see this wolfman!

09:14.170 --> 09:15.830
Looks like fun, doesn't it?

09:16.470 --> 09:19.640
Ah, I mean, we shouldn't over-do it...

09:20.040 --> 09:22.940
Don't worry about that, as long as it's fun!

09:22.940 --> 09:27.710
We'll scare 'em with this guy, and for
the final blow, a freaky vampire!

09:27.710 --> 09:29.380
This is gonna rule!

09:30.210 --> 09:31.920
Is it a bit much?

09:33.350 --> 09:34.620
That's okay, right?

09:39.660 --> 09:43.630
I'm sorry for keeping you so late.
I'll have the driver escort you home.

09:48.670 --> 09:49.900
Me too...

09:50.370 --> 09:52.900
I can't remember my Mom's voice, either.

09:53.470 --> 09:53.870
Eh?

09:54.740 --> 09:56.450
Same as you, Yurika-san.

10:01.350 --> 10:05.050
Hey, can I start callin' you Yurika?

10:05.680 --> 10:06.220
Sure.

10:06.620 --> 10:08.850
Great! Then you can call me Chocolat!

10:13.060 --> 10:16.010
Together let's make this Halloween
party spectacular.

10:20.970 --> 10:23.810
This persons hand is warm.

10:46.260 --> 10:48.330
Mmh! Great mood!

10:48.660 --> 10:52.060
Oh yeah! We're missing the bats!

10:52.900 --> 10:55.570
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

10:56.770 --> 10:59.000
Come out, lots of chocolate bats!

11:04.280 --> 11:05.930
Bats are coming this way!!!

11:06.240 --> 11:09.450
Chocolat-chan, you're scaring
everyone away! It's excessive!

11:09.450 --> 11:12.420
Take a lookit that! Everyone's havin' a blast!

11:14.490 --> 11:15.150
Huh?

11:18.120 --> 11:20.260
The bats are made of chocolate!

11:21.090 --> 11:23.870
You're right! I thought they were real!

11:24.030 --> 11:28.120
Right?! It took me forever to practice this trick!

11:28.120 --> 11:30.430
Amazing, Kato-san!

11:30.430 --> 11:32.830
This year's Halloween is so detailed!

11:33.240 --> 11:35.810
Thanks to your magic, everyone
looks like they're having fun!

11:35.810 --> 11:36.610
Yup!

11:36.610 --> 11:41.950
Next up, y'wanna help me out in gettin'
the gym to look reaaallly creepy?

11:42.410 --> 11:43.550
Nifty!

11:44.050 --> 11:46.680
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Rune!

11:47.620 --> 11:48.590
Wand!

11:50.590 --> 11:53.660
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

11:56.390 --> 11:57.100
Wand!

11:59.500 --> 12:02.950
Turn the gym into the Magic World Forest!

12:11.610 --> 12:14.630
Whoa! So authentic!

12:14.630 --> 12:18.180
I'm not too cool with real scary things...

12:18.180 --> 12:21.580
Weird. But you like frogs and snakes
and those kinda things.

12:21.920 --> 12:26.290
I love the occult! It gets me all excited!

12:26.290 --> 12:28.890
You can't judge a book by its cover.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.600
Looks like we'll be having a bonfire tonight!

12:34.100 --> 12:39.340
Sweet! It'd be even better if there
were a Frankenstein around!

12:44.480 --> 12:48.250
Ladies and gentlemen, step right up! Don't be shy!

12:48.250 --> 12:51.530
The Halloween party's main event:
the Super-Scary Test of Courage!

12:51.530 --> 12:52.850
We'll be waitin' for you at the gym!

12:54.000 --> 12:55.220
I am SO there!

13:00.890 --> 13:05.400
I'll just scare people like in the
Magic World! Piece o' cake!

13:05.400 --> 13:06.680
Oh my god.

13:06.900 --> 13:08.670
What are you doing, dressed up like that?

13:09.670 --> 13:13.810
What is with those clothes? Have you no taste?

13:13.810 --> 13:18.580
That does not reflect the proper image of our
institution. I feel ill, breathing even the same air...

13:18.580 --> 13:20.080
Those creeps.

13:20.080 --> 13:22.680
Do you think that I wanna share–

13:24.820 --> 13:27.680
I can't, I promised Yurika...

13:28.820 --> 13:30.690
"Together let's make this Halloween
party spectacular."

13:32.190 --> 13:35.930
Well then! I'm off to the test of courage!

13:35.930 --> 13:38.560
'Cause I want this to be a success!

13:42.830 --> 13:45.370
What is she thinking?

13:45.370 --> 13:48.270
Just because Yurika showed her some grace.

13:48.270 --> 13:51.440
I can't take much more of that big head of hers.

13:51.880 --> 13:52.810
Seriously.

13:56.150 --> 13:59.620
How's this? I call this "the bat-girl!"

14:00.080 --> 14:03.150
I'm going to scare 'em all to death!

14:03.350 --> 14:06.020
Ah! Chocolat-chan's so cute!

14:06.020 --> 14:07.190
Really. Quite nice.

14:07.590 --> 14:09.160
It suits you!

14:10.030 --> 14:12.950
She looks just like a broken umbrella.

14:13.130 --> 14:14.500
What'd you say?!

14:14.500 --> 14:18.570
I'm the spunky, cute, sexy bat-girl!

14:18.940 --> 14:20.900
Well! If you say so!

14:21.740 --> 14:24.910
Well! Houx, Saule, and I are off to do our thing inside!

14:24.910 --> 14:28.980
Vanilla's too scared to pull this off, so you'll
be helping out all the guests outside.

14:28.980 --> 14:29.910
Okay!

14:31.820 --> 14:36.480
Hey everyone! You gotta check out
this suuuuper scary test of courage!

14:37.050 --> 14:38.980
Please come in, two at a time!

14:42.660 --> 14:45.760
Okay guys, ready to scare 'em?

14:46.560 --> 14:48.100
Leave it to us.

14:48.100 --> 14:49.430
This is gonna be fun!

14:58.440 --> 15:00.380
Alrighty, final blow!

15:04.450 --> 15:05.080
I'm scared!

15:05.080 --> 15:05.520
I-I-It's o-okay! It's okay!
I'm scared!

15:05.520 --> 15:06.820
I-I-It's o-okay! It's okay!

15:06.820 --> 15:07.820
Perfect!

15:09.190 --> 15:10.090
Success!

15:18.130 --> 15:20.030
I'm freakin' them out!

15:21.230 --> 15:23.270
Huh? The color of their hearts...

15:25.240 --> 15:27.780
Am I playin' match-maker here?

15:28.070 --> 15:29.910
Whatever! It's a festival, right?

15:32.780 --> 15:34.450
I've heard it's a blast!

15:34.450 --> 15:37.250
I heard you enter together, and come out a couple!

15:37.450 --> 15:38.880
It looks interesting!

15:38.880 --> 15:41.250
This is the greatest Halloween ever!

15:41.520 --> 15:45.320
It looks like the Halloween party's
a success, thanks to Chocolat.

15:46.760 --> 15:50.760
Damnit. Now it's "thanks to Chocolat"?

15:50.760 --> 15:52.300
I don't like it.

15:52.300 --> 15:56.470
And Yurika's addressing her as "Chocolat."

15:56.470 --> 15:57.270
This isn't good.

16:12.080 --> 16:14.780
Looks like everyone's having fun.

16:15.120 --> 16:16.890
Everyone seems all lovey-dovey.

16:17.420 --> 16:19.790
Does scaring them do that?

16:20.820 --> 16:21.820
Vanilla came!

16:22.760 --> 16:24.230
Let's give her a real scare!

16:24.230 --> 16:25.580
All right!

16:26.730 --> 16:28.630
Are you okay, Ice-san?

16:35.940 --> 16:38.270
C-Cute!

16:39.510 --> 16:42.050
SUPER cute!!!

16:44.820 --> 16:47.780
Sugar Sugar Rune! Vani Rune!

16:48.150 --> 16:48.990
Wand!

16:50.020 --> 16:52.070
Hearts, hearts, please come to me!

17:08.210 --> 17:09.640
Chocolat-chan, I'm sorry!

17:09.640 --> 17:11.010
I just...

17:11.010 --> 17:15.650
Naw. After all that hard work,
just a pee-colored one...

17:17.880 --> 17:20.250
Chocolat, you did wonderfully today.

17:20.620 --> 17:23.020
Your plan was a huge success.

17:23.220 --> 17:23.920
Yurika!

17:24.320 --> 17:27.520
Having the bonfire afterwards
will be the perfect touch.

17:28.630 --> 17:30.030
Let's do our best.

17:32.060 --> 17:36.370
I'll be on standby before the event,
so please hurry and join me.

17:36.700 --> 17:37.770
Okay!

17:38.840 --> 17:40.740
I'll be waiting for you there too, okay?

17:42.840 --> 17:49.050
I will romantically spice up the bonfire
with my "Chocolate Party" magic!

17:56.950 --> 17:59.470
No way. It won't open.

18:01.830 --> 18:04.680
Who's got a big head now?

18:04.930 --> 18:07.860
You stay here until tne Halloween party's over.

18:08.170 --> 18:09.770
Like a bat, right?

18:09.770 --> 18:10.900
You poor thing!

18:22.980 --> 18:24.910
What's keeping you, Chocolat?

18:25.380 --> 18:27.420
You're supposed to light the bonfire...

18:27.790 --> 18:30.150
Who knows? Maybe she got bored and went home?

18:30.950 --> 18:33.490
That sounds like something shed do.

18:33.490 --> 18:36.030
That girl is so unreliable, you know.

18:36.030 --> 18:39.380
Seems you've been deceived, Yurika.
You're always too kind.

18:42.000 --> 18:45.640
What do I do? I hope someone finds me in time.

18:46.540 --> 18:52.240
I've used too much magic already, or
I could handle a measly locked door.

18:57.310 --> 18:59.360
P-Pierre!

18:59.880 --> 19:02.370
Hey. It appears you're in trouble.

19:02.370 --> 19:05.150
Wh-what are you doing in here?!

19:06.690 --> 19:09.890
It looks like you could use some help.

19:10.830 --> 19:13.090
Then quit your yappin' and help me outta here!

19:13.360 --> 19:16.670
I have to start the bonfire!

19:16.670 --> 19:20.370
Can anyone hear me?! Isn't anyone out there?!

19:21.410 --> 19:22.370
Wow!

19:23.440 --> 19:25.610
Poor thing. You're bleeding.

19:26.910 --> 19:28.850
S'fine. No big deal.

19:30.910 --> 19:32.620
Hush, and give me your hand.

19:40.520 --> 19:41.320
That's better.

19:41.820 --> 19:43.320
L-lemme go!

19:47.030 --> 19:49.830
Still, you cannot express any gratitude?

19:52.740 --> 19:55.090
T-thanks.

19:57.310 --> 19:59.040
You're welcome.

19:59.540 --> 20:02.300
But, how'll we get outta here?

20:02.710 --> 20:05.520
How? Surely you must know.

20:09.790 --> 20:10.490
Yurika!

20:15.190 --> 20:16.230
Are you okay?

20:17.530 --> 20:19.400
You were late, and had me worried.

20:19.760 --> 20:23.360
Sorry, I was stuck in here
and couldn't get out.

20:23.870 --> 20:25.130
But I'm so relieved.

20:25.440 --> 20:27.600
That I realized that you were locked in.

20:27.910 --> 20:29.410
Mmh! Thanks!

20:29.870 --> 20:35.630
Well, the bonfire is starting. Shall we
go? Everyone's waiting for you.

20:36.050 --> 20:37.880
That is, after you, Prince, of course.

20:38.880 --> 20:42.320
Dancing around fires makes me uneasy. Later.

20:46.620 --> 20:48.560
Chocolat, look through your peek-a-boo glasses!

20:51.500 --> 20:53.160
Well, I'm going ahead.

20:55.800 --> 20:58.040
The noir heart of jealousy!

20:58.040 --> 20:58.500
Huh?

20:59.140 --> 21:03.240
A black heart is called "noir." In other words, it is made of the darkness of jealousy!

21:03.610 --> 21:04.570
Dark nature?

21:06.410 --> 21:09.830
Yurika. Are you...of Pierre and me?

21:31.170 --> 21:33.440
Yurika has a black heart...

21:33.900 --> 21:36.770
...it's probably because of me.

21:43.780 --> 21:45.070
Are you okay?

21:46.020 --> 21:47.020
Aren't you cold?

21:47.550 --> 21:49.950
Please use this, if you like.

21:52.290 --> 21:53.830
Thanks a lot!

21:54.290 --> 21:58.290
Not at all! Just a thank you for all
your hard work today, Chocolat.

21:58.700 --> 22:00.860
Mmh! You too, Yurika!

22:00.860 --> 22:02.870
Let's go, shall we?

22:05.040 --> 22:07.940
Good thing, Yurika is still so kind.

22:23.190 --> 22:29.470
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.600 --> 22:30.970
"Love"

22:31.910 --> 22:35.410
A magic spell.

22:37.580 --> 22:44.850
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.280 --> 22:54.360
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.030 --> 23:00.300
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.900 --> 23:03.970
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.270 --> 23:11.340
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.710 --> 23:16.150
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.150 --> 23:26.260
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.320 --> 23:35.170
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.160 --> 23:48.640
Blanca, you're acting really weird!

23:48.640 --> 23:50.190
That's not true at all!

23:50.190 --> 23:52.310
What's up between you and that cheese-store guy?

